WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.667
MFA was on.

00:02.667 --> 00:05.333
The attacker still got in.

00:05.333 --> 00:08.000
I tested 130 sign-in cases to find where each control stops.

00:08.000 --> 00:11.333
The rule: write the guess first.

00:11.333 --> 00:14.667
A Run 6 guess is shown with its SHA-256 hash, committed before any code existed.

00:14.667 --> 00:18.000
Change one word and the hash breaks, and a wrong guess stays wrong.

00:18.000 --> 00:23.333
The framework: seven links every sign-in passes through.

00:23.333 --> 00:28.667
Enroll and recover (17 cases), prove (14), trust (21), decide (33), issue (16), act (14), and watch and end (15).

00:28.667 --> 00:34.000
A weak link anywhere lets the attacker through, however strong MFA is at link 2.

00:34.000 --> 00:38.333
Case W06: a stolen integration token goes from the attacker to the API to the customer records, and MFA is never asked.

00:38.333 --> 00:42.667
An address allow-list refuses it.

00:42.667 --> 00:47.000
Where the token can be used from decided the case.

00:47.000 --> 00:53.500
Case G03: an AI sub-agent writes where the person who asked cannot.

00:53.500 --> 01:00.000
Switching the controls on and off one at a time, only C, the resource checking the person’s own rights, held.

01:00.000 --> 01:06.000
Case G07: a cookie stolen after MFA.

01:06.000 --> 01:12.000
When the attacker appears to be on the victim’s network, continuous evaluation misses it and only binding the session to the device holds.

01:12.000 --> 01:17.000
What came out: 130 cases, 124 run on models, 118 guesses matched, 6 wrong.

01:17.000 --> 01:22.000
Run 1 41 of 41, Run 2 39 of 45, Run 3 16 of 16, Run 5 12 of 12, Run 6 10 of 10.

01:22.000 --> 01:30.000
Your turn: run the real scripts in your browser, change an assumption, or break a guess and watch the hash stop it.

01:30.000 --> 01:31.200
130 cases, the 72-page book, the browser lab, everything public.

01:31.200 --> 01:32.400
roshantrivedi.co.in/ca-mfa-lab.

01:32.400 --> 01:33.600
Made-up data.

01:33.600 --> 01:34.800
Independent work.

01:34.800 --> 01:36.000
Nothing about any employer or client.
